WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.410
Give thanks!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.420
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.790
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.960
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:48.220
Someone once said:

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:52.460
There is the Ice Cream Mountain 
Range with rich vanilla, mint,

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:57.660
and chocolate peaks that 
melt gently in your mouth...

00:01:58.460 --> 00:02:02.470
And delectable Bowl Fruit which taste of

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:06.300
pork cutlet bowls, tempura 
bowls, and beef bowls...

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:08.970
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:09.210 --> 00:02:13.680
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:18.280
Today, we've come to the Central 
Gourmet Wholesale Market!

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:20.690
With a total area of 3000 hectares,

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:24.560
this marketplace is 640 times the 
size of the Gourmet Dome ballpark,

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:30.560
and every day more than 900,000 tons of 
ingredients are sold for a trillion yen!

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:36.900
The Well Mellowed 7-Colored Fruit 
Juice! Pick the Rainbow Fruit!

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:42.740
Wow, awesome! It's a Tsuchinoko Turtle!

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:46.080
Komatsu-kun, if you don't hurry, 
the target will get sold off.

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:49.010
I keep getting distracted by all 
these different ingredients!

00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:52.080
The Central Gourmet Wholesale Market 
really is something, all right!

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:52.980
What was that?

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:54.220
Try sayin' that again!

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:56.890
Sure! I'll say it again and again!

00:02:56.890 --> 00:03:00.760
The mouth is open on this Fishtachio! 
That's proof it's not fresh!

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:04.400
Filming this ingredient isn't going 
to move my viewers even one gram!

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:05.500
Hey, Tina!

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:07.430
We're live!

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:11.900
I apologize for that...

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:13.840
This is Tina, signing off

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:17.240
with an extra-large helping 
from this busy marketplace!

00:03:17.510 --> 00:03:19.940
Gourmet News

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:21.550
Now, where was I?

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:23.680
Her personality's completely changed...

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:25.250
News is about the quantity of information!

00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:26.680
Weight is its life!

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:30.460
A Fishtachio that's no longer fresh doesn't 
even weigh a gram's worth of info!

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:32.320
My viewers' appetites won't be satisfied!

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:35.630
It's a violation of the 
broadcast standards of me,

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:37.030
Gourmet TV's Gourmet Newscaster, Tina!

00:03:37.030 --> 00:03:40.260
You eat these things when 
their mouths are open!

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:42.800
This is why I hate amateurs!

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:44.270
U-Um...

00:03:44.270 --> 00:03:45.800
That's true when you eat them...

00:03:46.140 --> 00:03:49.170
But it's better for their mouths 
to still be shut when at market...

00:03:49.170 --> 00:03:51.410
The flavor will be spoiled otherwise,

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:54.350
so I think it's best to open 
them right before cooking.

00:03:55.780 --> 00:03:58.480
Hey, you trying to badmouth my ingredients?

00:03:58.480 --> 00:04:01.450
Not 0.1 milligrams of your 
ingredients are at fault!

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:03.490
It's <i>you</i> that's the problem!

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:04.760
Oh, yeah?!

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:05.690
What you gonna do?!

00:04:05.690 --> 00:04:06.620
Komatsu!

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:08.660
Toriko-san!

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:09.990
It's Toriko, the Gourmet Hunter!

00:04:10.260 --> 00:04:12.900
Sir, you're a friend of Toriko's?

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:18.370
I came to sell off this guy I captured.

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:20.470
Wow! It's an Underbite Dragon!

00:04:20.470 --> 00:04:23.070
A pterosaurian beast, Capture Level 4!

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:26.480
And what's more... That's the 
charismatic Gourmet Hunter, Toriko!

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:29.710
What a full helping of scrumptious news!

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:31.920
You're Toriko, right? I'm Tina!

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:32.550
Huh?

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:36.720
This is my carrier balloon pigeon, Kuruppo!

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:40.930
To be able to meet you, my luck 
today must be super-sized!

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:42.530
No, super-duper-sized!

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:44.230
I'm a Gourmet Newscaster

00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:47.930
who shows all kinds of ingredients around 
the world to people on Gourmet TV!

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:50.600
Please, Toriko! Let me do 
an interview for my program!

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:52.840
Any interviews must go 
through the proper channels.

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:54.570
What?

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:56.940
The IGO!

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:58.240
None other.

00:04:58.240 --> 00:04:59.880
I am Johannes,

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:02.710
Chief of Ingredients Development 
at the IGO's Research Department.

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:04.380
Back down, Tina.

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:05.720
Why?

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:07.820
They're the International 
Gourmet Organization, the IGO!

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:10.050
Against them, you'll never get an interview!

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:11.890
Even though Toriko's right here?

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:15.160
Let go of me! Hey! Stop this!

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:16.690
You plan on blocking my interview?

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:18.300
You don't have to be so...

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:18.100
Isn't the IGO supposed to 
be an open organization?

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:21.500
Things might turn sour if the mass 
media starts asking questions.

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:20.530
This is tyranny!

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:23.000
I have a duty to report on the news!

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:23.900
Toriko-san, I'm glad I ran into you.

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:25.370
Everyone is waiting for my reports!

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:27.770
I have a job I would like you to handle.

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:29.170
Let me interview Toriko! 
An exclusive interview!

00:05:27.770 --> 00:05:31.940
Huh? Why don't you just have some 
of the IGO Gourmet Hunters do it?

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:34.080
It's not like it has to be me...

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:36.080
The Rainbow Fruit are ripe.

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:37.320
What?

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:39.180
R-Rainbow Fruit?!

00:05:39.180 --> 00:05:40.620
The legendary fruit

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:42.190
that changes into seven 
different color flavors

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:43.890
depending on the temperature and humidity?

00:05:43.890 --> 00:05:45.620
Hey! Keep your voice down!

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:47.390
What'll happen if someone hears you?

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:50.160
You bet I'm gonna shout it out!

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:54.030
Just one little droplet of juice 
from a Rainbow Fruit is enough

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:57.270
to turn an entire 25-meter 
swimming pool's worth of water

00:05:57.270 --> 00:06:00.710
into rich, mellow-tasting juice!

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:02.940
That's how incredibly, amazingly 
concentrated its juices are!

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:06.480
I've heard that one will 
sell for 500,000,000...

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:08.510
But weren't they extinct?

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:11.020
It is true they no longer exist in nature.

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:15.250
I see! So you're talking about the 
IGO's specialty, selective breeding!

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:17.920
There is only one problem...

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:21.990
Troll Kongs have made a nest 
around the Rainbow Fruit Tree.

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:23.660
No one can get near it.

00:06:23.660 --> 00:06:25.130
Troll Kongs?!

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:28.300
The ultimate gorilla, the Troll Kong.

00:06:28.730 --> 00:06:34.040
A 2 billion yen Gourmet Tank was 
dispatched, but it was wiped out.

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:35.970
Completely turned upside down.

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:39.080
A 40-ton tank, just like that.

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:41.950
For your information, 
their Capture Level is 9.

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:44.250
Capture difficulty level of 9?!

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:47.920
The capture level of the 300-year-old 
Gararagator the last time was only 8!

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:50.290
Always wanted to try eatin' a Rainbow Fruit.

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:52.860
Maybe I should show my 
face once in a while...

00:06:52.860 --> 00:06:55.190
...in that dear old "Garden".

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:57.730
Dear old garden?

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:06.300
What the... It's huge!

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:10.040
This is the number 8 biotope, 
nicknamed the "Garden".

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:13.810
It's an artificially constructed 
habitat for animals and plants.

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:15.980
Made as close as possible to nature,

00:07:15.980 --> 00:07:18.950
a large variety of flora and 
fauna live freely within.

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:24.490
The IGO studies the ecology of Gourmet 
creatures within this biotope.

00:07:24.490 --> 00:07:26.060
I see.

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:28.630
Thanks for the meal, Toriko-sama!

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:32.760
Cut it out with that greeting, will 
ya? I haven't treated you to anything.

00:07:33.630 --> 00:07:38.200
This Gourmet Newscaster ain't 
afraid of the IGO, no way!

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:42.040
The people of the world are waiting 
for a full helping of delicious news!

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:43.680
Even if I'm on my own...

00:07:46.180 --> 00:07:47.580
What was that?! Lightning?

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:48.910
Drumming!

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:50.050
Drumming?

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:54.520
It's a gorilla's special way of intimidation.

00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:57.920
We just got word from the observation tower

00:07:57.920 --> 00:08:00.060
that there's a Troll Kong 
right inside the gate.

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:05.600
You can hear the Troll Kong's drumming 
even through that thick concrete wall?

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:10.440
Sounds like the king of the garden 
is warning me not to enter.

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:13.200
I don't care! Open the gate!

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:18.040
The rules are we can't open the gate while 
there's a beast within 5 kilometers.

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:20.410
Man, your rules are such a pain.

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:24.280
Anyway, it just has to be farther 
away than 5 kilometers, right?

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:27.390
If it's already gone when you 
open it, then no problem.

00:08:30.520 --> 00:08:32.620
If it's gonna threaten me from over there...

00:08:33.160 --> 00:08:35.230
I'll threaten it from over here!

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:37.630
What's he gonna do?

00:08:54.350 --> 00:08:56.450
Three-fold...

00:08:57.450 --> 00:08:59.620
Spiked Punch!

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:02.820
One!

00:09:03.590 --> 00:09:04.290
Two!

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:06.460
Three!

00:09:07.030 --> 00:09:08.430
All opened up.

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:15.530
What have you done?

00:09:16.130 --> 00:09:17.640
Spiked Punch.

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:22.440
A punch where I hit the same 
place multiple times at once.

00:09:22.440 --> 00:09:25.440
Like driving in a spike,

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:28.010
the destruction of this punch goes deep!

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:31.150
Anyway, I'll be off now.

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:32.980
W-Wait for me!

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:37.620
Looks like rain.

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:39.690
The Rainbow Fruit tree is quite tall,

00:09:39.690 --> 00:09:41.290
so it'll be a problem if lightning strikes.

00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:42.530
We've got to hurry.

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:43.830
Right!

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:48.170
A pitfall?

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:05.850
Troll Kong (mammalian beast)

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:05.850
Capture Level 9

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:11.360
Knocking!

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:32.540
Sorry about this. I paralyzed 
you with my Knocking Gun.

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:35.650
Stay like that a while, and you'll 
be able to move before long.

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:37.080
Knocking?

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:39.180
A technique used to capture prey

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:43.250
by shocking their nerves with 
needles, which causes paralysis...

00:10:43.690 --> 00:10:47.930
Toriko-san, why Knocking? 
Shouldn't you finish it off?

00:10:47.930 --> 00:10:51.400
Huh? There's no reason to take its life.

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:54.230
We're after the Rainbow Fruit, remember?

00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:57.000
Well, yeah, but...

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:59.000
Let's go, Komatsu.

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:02.970
After being slobbered over, the 
thing's smell is all over me.

00:11:04.840 --> 00:11:06.080
We have to evacuate, quick!

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:09.980
Until a tank platoon shows up, you have 
to prevent any beasts from getting out!

00:11:13.990 --> 00:11:16.550
I can't even describe how 
sweet the air smells...

00:11:16.550 --> 00:11:19.620
Yeah... The Rainbow Fruit 
is near, I can smell it!

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:24.630
The sweet fragrance of the Rainbow Fruit 
can lure animals, and make them swoon.

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:27.970
The meat-eating Troll 
Kongs don't eat the fruit,

00:11:27.970 --> 00:11:31.470
but they make their nest 
around the Rainbow Fruit tree

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:33.770
to eat the animals that are lured there.

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:37.340
But you Knocked the Troll Kong already,

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:39.440
so we shouldn't have trouble 
getting the fruit, right?

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:41.210
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:11:41.210 --> 00:11:43.310
That guy was the weakest in the troop.

00:11:43.310 --> 00:11:44.550
A scout.

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:45.680
T-Troop?

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:47.850
Look, we can see them now.

00:11:56.630 --> 00:12:00.530
Sheesh... What am I gonna 
do against this many?

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:03.940
I've got the smell of 
the weakest all over me,

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:06.840
so even if I was serious, 
intimidation wouldn't work.

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:09.410
And with the Rainbow Fruit 
right in front of us...

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:13.750
It's over...

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:18.720
I can already see the pearly gates...

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:23.760
Komatsu, grab onto my back!

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:26.560
Hold on to me with your very soul!

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:30.190
You lose your grip for one-hundredth 
of a second, and your life is toast!

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:33.800
Okay! And uh, we'll get 
through this alive, right?

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:34.870
Dunno!

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:36.100
Pray for us!

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:52.850
W-What? They've been Knocked?

00:12:52.850 --> 00:12:55.020
But why...?

00:13:03.230 --> 00:13:04.400
Knocking!

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:07.230
Knocking!

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:18.980
Toriko-san, this isn't 
the time to be Knocking!

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:22.610
I told you already, Komatsu. Our goal 
is the Rainbow Fruit, and that's all.

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:23.720
B-But...

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:29.590
Plus, Troll Kong meat is sinewy 
and not something you want to eat.

00:13:30.520 --> 00:13:34.760
Unless I plan on eating it, I 
don't take the lives of my prey.

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:38.400
I don't kill what I don't eat.

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:41.400
And if I kill something, I eat it!

00:13:42.770 --> 00:13:44.900
That's my rule.

00:13:58.050 --> 00:14:01.920
Knocking... His only goal is the 
Rainbow Fruit, no matter what!

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:08.060
Gourmet Hunter Toriko... He's a 
giga-sized helping of awesome!

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:15.130
Knocking!

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:20.740
There's no end to this.

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:22.810
They operate in a completely 
vertically structured society.

00:14:22.810 --> 00:14:25.310
I can't finish this until I beat their boss!

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:27.410
Knocking!

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:35.320
Guess their grip really is 
stronger than 1 ton of force!

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:37.590
T-Toriko-san!

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:44.500
It sensed my threat?

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:46.900
The rain... That's it!

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:52.770
The rain is washing away the 
smell of that weakest one...

00:14:52.770 --> 00:14:54.510
Okay, perfect!

00:15:00.610 --> 00:15:01.480
What the...

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:05.950
Huh?

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:07.550
I've stopped shaking...

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:14.560
What was that?

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:25.340
That was close! If it had hit the 
Rainbow Fruit tree, that'd be it!

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:27.540
We have to find the boss, quick!

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:30.640
Which one was the first to 
be scared of the lightning?

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:32.410
Why do you ask that?

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:33.710
Because that's the boss!

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:37.480
Wouldn't the boss be the least scared?

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:38.380
The opposite!

00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:42.420
The boss of the troop needs the ability 
to sense danger more than strength.

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:46.090
The one who sees danger coming first 
is the most suited to be the boss!

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:47.130
In that case...

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:51.430
There was one that hid before 
the lightning struck.

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:52.130
What?

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:55.170
The white one in the back...

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:58.440
Him? I see.

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:03.040
The white coat that shows 
his age... A silverback!

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:04.810
Silverback

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:04.840
I've found you!

00:16:04.840 --> 00:16:07.350
That was really perceptive of you!

00:16:07.350 --> 00:16:12.580
Thanks... But for some reason, when 
I'm on your back, my fear goes away,

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:15.620
and I can look around calmly, or rather...

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:17.460
It's kind of strange.

00:16:17.460 --> 00:16:19.360
Gotta hand this one to you, Komatsu!

00:16:19.920 --> 00:16:20.790
Thanks!

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:23.230
Now then...

00:16:23.660 --> 00:16:29.370
The scent of that weak one should 
be completely washed away by now.

00:17:16.610 --> 00:17:18.750
He tamed the Troll Kongs...

00:17:19.420 --> 00:17:21.220
What a peaceful end to the battle...

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:32.360
Toriko-san!

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:33.160
Yeah!

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:42.440
Rainbow Fruit!

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:51.150
How beautiful!

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:54.250
Hey, it's Tina! What are you doing here?!

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:57.190
Oops, I kinda tagged along...

00:17:57.560 --> 00:17:58.660
Oh?

00:17:59.520 --> 00:18:02.960
Ah, don't worry! I'm only taking one!

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:05.600
I don't plan on endangering your way of life.

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:09.670
E-Everyone, I've got a 
delicious scoop of news!

00:18:09.670 --> 00:18:11.740
The Gourmet Hunter Toriko has 
gotten a Rainbow Fruit...

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:14.570
I said, no interviews without permission.

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:16.710
You won't even let me have a single shot?

00:18:16.940 --> 00:18:18.710
Eject her from the premises.

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:22.250
Let me go! Hey! The Rainbow Fruit! Toriko!

00:18:24.280 --> 00:18:25.820
The Rainbow Fruit...

00:18:25.820 --> 00:18:28.090
We are already making our move.

00:18:28.090 --> 00:18:31.960
However, we have learned that 
one has been captured already.

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:33.830
Toriko, is it?

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:37.460
Perhaps his aim may be that 
which will unite the world...

00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:40.730
That certain transcendent ingredient...

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:55.680
Thanks for waiting!

00:18:55.680 --> 00:18:57.180
The Rainbow Fruit!

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:05.190
This sweet, mellow aroma... Incredible!

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:10.360
The fruit juice is vaporizing, 
and creating a rainbow!

00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:15.500
I-I knew eating it this 
way would be delicious...

00:19:15.830 --> 00:19:18.970
I've kept the fruit at 5 degrees C.

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:22.870
As time passes, its temperature 
will rise, and the flavor...

00:19:23.570 --> 00:19:25.440
...will also change, yes?

00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:27.950
Okay, time to dig in.

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:32.150
I give thanks for all this world's bounty...

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:33.580
Let's eat!

00:19:33.580 --> 00:19:36.920
Toriko-san can barely get the words out...

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:42.230
So smooth, almost like pudding!

00:19:42.230 --> 00:19:46.000
But, it's heavy... Almost as heavy as gold!

00:19:56.270 --> 00:19:59.140
The flavor changed four 
times within my mouth!

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:02.780
The sweetness of hundreds 
of ripe mangoes, condensed!

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:07.820
Lemons or kiwis don't compare 
to its bursts of tartness!

00:20:09.820 --> 00:20:14.060
The fifth flavor! This time, 
the aroma of sweet chestnuts!

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:16.060
This is a one-stop shop for flavor!

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:19.830
The sixth...

00:20:20.160 --> 00:20:23.570
It feels like an explosion, 
all the way down my throat!

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:28.940
The blood departing my heart takes about 
1 minute to circulate around my body!

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:31.910
It feels like an eternity 
compared to the instant in which

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:34.610
this sweetness surges 
throughout my whole being!

00:20:34.610 --> 00:20:35.910
So satisfying!

00:20:38.050 --> 00:20:40.080
T-Toriko-san?

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:42.450
So good...

00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:45.020
It's so good!

00:20:50.260 --> 00:20:53.600
I've decided on my dessert!

00:20:55.530 --> 00:20:58.500
I have decided!

00:20:58.500 --> 00:21:03.110
The Dessert for my Full Course Menu 
of life will be Rainbow Fruit!

00:21:05.210 --> 00:21:08.180
Komatsu, gather all the staff!

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:11.220
Let's have everyone eat the Rainbow Fruit!

00:21:11.220 --> 00:21:13.850
It'll taste even better if we share!

00:21:13.850 --> 00:21:15.120
R-Right!

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:22.390
This is a problem.

00:21:22.790 --> 00:21:24.700
I don't like this fortune...

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:29.300
"A man with a triple-lined scar 
under his left eye will appear," eh?

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:31.870
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:21:40.310 --> 00:21:45.980
Is the night wind caressing my cheek

00:21:46.520 --> 00:21:52.260
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:52.990 --> 00:21:59.500
Each time I move out, the direction of the wind changes.

00:21:59.900 --> 00:22:04.440
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:22:05.700 --> 00:22:09.540
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:22:09.540 --> 00:22:12.910
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:22:12.910 --> 00:22:17.380
on a journey with no end!

00:22:19.220 --> 00:22:22.350
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:22:22.350 --> 00:22:25.490
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:25.490 --> 00:22:31.500
amid the waves of time.

00:22:34.200 --> 00:22:36.000
Gourmet News!

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:38.400
Good morning!

00:22:38.400 --> 00:22:39.970
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:39.970 --> 00:22:42.270
What were the ingredients 
that Toriko captured today?

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:43.680
Underbite Dragon.

00:22:43.680 --> 00:22:45.080
Rainbow Fruit.

00:22:45.080 --> 00:22:48.180
A small portion for Toriko, 
and half for the IGO.

00:22:48.180 --> 00:22:50.450
The remaining half will be sold at auction,

00:22:50.450 --> 00:22:53.750
and people around the world are 
drooling just thinking about it!

00:22:53.750 --> 00:22:56.450
Unfortunately, thanks to the IGO's refusal,

00:22:56.450 --> 00:22:59.890
we are not able to show you footage 
of him picking the Rainbow Fruit.

00:22:59.890 --> 00:23:01.490
That jerk, Johannes...

00:23:02.430 --> 00:23:04.230
And now, the next story...

00:23:06.760 --> 00:23:08.330
When the Puffer Whales appear

00:23:08.330 --> 00:23:10.220
the stocks of the gourmet industry start to rise!

00:23:10.540 --> 00:23:13.790
Cooperation from the Heavenly Kings will be needed to retrieve this ingredient.

00:23:13.790 --> 00:23:16.940
Prepare It! The Poisonous Puffer Whale! The Heavenly King Coco Appears!!

00:23:17.240 --> 00:23:19.380
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
